Package: forptnemeton
Title: ForPT Embeddings of LiDAR Point Clouds for 'nemeton'
Version: 2026.11.2
Authors@R:
    person("Pascal", "Obstétar", , "pascal.obstetar@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns a normalised airborne LiDAR point cloud into a raster of
    embeddings from the frozen ForPT encoder (LitePT-S, self-supervised on
    forest laser scans, ETH Zurich 2026), one band per dimension, cached as
    content-addressed COGs ready for the 'nemeton' package (structural
    indicator N5, spec 067). The encoder runs in Python through 'reticulate'
    and needs a CUDA GPU.
